*_old.json
reference_dashboard*.html
reference_dashboard_data/

# Generated dashboard outputs.
# Epic #96 moved theme / network / temporal / UMAP generation to the hallu
# cron (deploy-dashboard.yml just consumes them). Those outputs MUST be
# committed via the cron's auto-update PR so CI can read them on a fresh
# checkout. Locally regenerated by `run_full_analysis.sh`; keep transient
# noise (aggregated/comprehensive JSONs, interactive HTML) gitignored.
dashboard_data/aggregated_data.json
dashboard_data/comprehensive_theme_analysis.json
dashboard_data/visualizations/
# NOTE: dashboard_data/{themes,network,temporal}/ and dashboard_data/*.csv
# are tracked (committed by the hallu cron, consumed by deploy-dashboard.yml).
# Do NOT add gitignore patterns for them.

# Interactive report outputs
interactive_reports/*.html
interactive_reports/data/

# Embeddings outputs.
# Epic #96 moved generation to the hallu cron; the resulting `embeddings/`
# tree (citation_embeddings/, dataset_embeddings/, analysis/, metadata/)
# is committed via the cron's auto-update PR and consumed by the deploy
# workflow. Local `analysis/` and `embedding_registry.json` regenerate
# deterministically; keep the registry gitignored only when running
# locally without the cron.
# NOTE: embeddings/{analysis,citation_embeddings,dataset_embeddings}/ and
# embeddings/metadata/ are tracked (cron-produced, deploy-consumed).
# Do NOT add gitignore patterns for them.

